  "draftedBy": "claude-code",
  "notes": "Andorran system (Escola Andorrana). The law confirms the stages and durations: primera ensenyança 6 courses in three cycles (ages 6–12), segona ensenyança 4 courses in two cycles (12–16), batxillerat 2 courses. Unconfirmed: the per-year names (1r de primera ensenyança, etc.) follow Catalan usage but no official page lists them. The French and Spanish systems also run schools in Andorra and use their own countries' class names."
